      "alt": "TQMa28 Smallest Arm9™ module",
      "text": "<h1>Based on i.MX28 featuring good graphics and computing power in compact format</h1>\n<p>The TQMa28 is the smallest Arm9™ module based on i.MX28, offering a balance of good graphics and computing power. With low power consumption (typ. 1 W) and compact dimensions, it is ideal for applications where space and energy efficiency are critical. This BGA module provides a wide temperature range, 2x IEEE1588 Ethernet support, and is a part of NXP Hardware Partner Embedded solutions. It's designed for smart metering, easy visualization, and control applications, making it a cost-effective choice for embedded projects.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 01 2026 01:10:29 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
